Description: Intel Edge graphics core -dev runtime metapackage
 Installs the core Intel Edge graphics -dev runtime stack for headless or CLI systems.
 This metapackage provides Mesa and GPU userspace -dev dependencies without display server components such as Wayland, Xorg, or desktop compositors.

